1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,280
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,480
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,320
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,200
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,800
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,360
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,080
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,720
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,880
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,480
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:10,520
=Episode 11=

17
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,319
(It's this late already.)

18
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,879
(Why is she getting dressed up?)

19
00:01:47,359 --> 00:01:48,400
What are you doing here?

20
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,439
I know you're uncomfortable.

21
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,079
I came here just to see you.

22
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:54,719
You shouldn't be here.

23
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:55,959
Go.

24
00:01:57,599 --> 00:01:59,480
Do you really want me to leave?

25
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,719
Can I stay

26
00:02:14,719 --> 00:02:15,919
tonight?

27
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,240
All right.

28
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:43,039
(Isn't that Adjutant Tan?)

29
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:45,000
(So, He Jingchen...)

30
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,599
(I'll deal with you first.)

31
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,080
Adjutant Tan.

32
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,400
Butler Zhou.

33
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,719
Is the governor still in his study?

34
00:02:58,159 --> 00:02:59,639
Yes, he's in there.

35
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:01,840
(He Jingchen.)

36
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,599
(You're finished this time.)

37
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,000
Wait.

38
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,599
The governor said

39
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,560
not to disturb him

40
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,360
unless it's important.

41
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,960
Don't worry.

42
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,360
He won't blame me.

43
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:12,919
Adjutant Tan!

44
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:13,479
Adjutant Tan!

45
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,439
I knew it.

46
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:50,360
You do have feelings for me.

47
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,800
(You're sure you saw it yourself?)

48
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:19,600
(Absolutely.)

49
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,879
(Or I wouldn't dare wake you, Governor.)

50
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,600
(No.)

51
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,920
(Not at a time like this.)

52
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,240
(He Jingchen can't fall now.)

53
00:04:30,399 --> 00:04:32,240
(I can't take on Lu Zhentian alone.)

54
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,079
How could it be...

55
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,240
It's the tea.

56
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,920
Something's wrong with the tea.

57
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:51,360
You set me up.

58
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,399
Su Yutang.

59
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:54,519
Stay out of this.

60
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:55,680
You two idiots.

61
00:04:57,519 --> 00:04:58,480
If you want to live,

62
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,160
do exactly as I say.

63
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:23,079
He Jingchen!

64
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:27,959
Father.

65
00:05:28,279 --> 00:05:29,199
Yutang?

66
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,000
Governor.

67
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,160
Ms. Lu?

68
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:34,920
Why are you here?

69
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:44,120
Governor,

70
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,959
the cup does contain an aphrodisiac.

71
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,639
Governor.

72
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:52,600
Lady Feng has been resting in her room
the whole time.

73
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,199
She even had dinner there.

74
00:05:54,439 --> 00:05:55,199
Governor.

75
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,639
I clearly saw Lady Feng

76
00:05:56,639 --> 00:05:59,319
committing adultery with He Jingchen.

77
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:00,519
Adjutant Tan.

78
00:06:01,759 --> 00:06:03,040
Watch your words.

79
00:06:03,879 --> 00:06:05,959
So now you're accusing me
of adultery with him?

80
00:06:07,879 --> 00:06:08,680
I wouldn't dare.

81
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:10,120
Adjutant Tan.

82
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,399
I have no quarrel with you.

83
00:06:12,959 --> 00:06:15,439
You sent flowers to my room last month,

84
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,720
and I threw them out.

85
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:20,120
You've served the governor for years,

86
00:06:20,279 --> 00:06:21,319
so I kept it quiet

87
00:06:21,639 --> 00:06:23,160
and never told him.

88
00:06:23,519 --> 00:06:25,839
I never thought love would turn to hate

89
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,639
and make you slander me like this.

90
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,000
Governor.

91
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,680
Governor!

92
00:06:31,319 --> 00:06:34,199
Someone knows I'm about to
bear you a son

93
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:36,480
and is plotting against me.

94
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,959
All right. That's enough.

95
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,360
Butler Zhou.

96
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:41,240
Take Lady Feng back to her room.

97
00:06:41,759 --> 00:06:42,560
Governor.

98
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,160
Take care of yourself too.

99
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:45,639
Don't get too worked up.

100
00:06:49,839 --> 00:06:50,480
Governor!

101
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,519
I've been framed, Governor!

102
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,600
They're all in on it!

103
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:54,959
He Jingchen
is the one lusting after her!

104
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,959
Ms. Lu, you're helping them too!

105
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,360
You've all fallen for He Jingchen's act!

106
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,839
Lady Feng's pregnancy is...

107
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,240
Get up.

108
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:16,839
Yes.

109
00:07:17,079 --> 00:07:18,959
I know you were framed.

110
00:07:19,399 --> 00:07:20,399
But

111
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:23,120
my daughter is still a young woman.

112
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:24,879
Rumors would hurt her reputation.

113
00:07:25,519 --> 00:07:26,199
Please understand.

114
00:07:26,399 --> 00:07:27,560
I'll make it up to you.

115
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:31,920
I'm honored by Ms. Lu's affection,

116
00:07:32,279 --> 00:07:33,079
but I don't deserve it.

117
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,519
But Governor...

118
00:07:35,759 --> 00:07:39,079
I have no designs on her.

119
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:40,199
I know.

120
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,800
Father.

121
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:45,000
But I have designs on him.

122
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:47,560
Dr. Liang.

123
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,279
Yes.

124
00:07:48,279 --> 00:07:49,600
Take Commander He for treatment.

125
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,199
Once you leave this room,

126
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,360
no one is to mention this again.

127
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:57,480
I won't have my daughter

128
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:59,319
become the subject of gossip.

129
00:08:00,439 --> 00:08:01,040
Yes.

130
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:01,920
Go.

131
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,600
You...

132
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,560
Of all the men out there,

133
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,319
why does it have to be Jingchen?

134
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,600
I'm telling you,

135
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,879
Jingchen is out of the question.

136
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,879
Why?

137
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,720
Father,

138
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,839
I just like him.

139
00:08:25,079 --> 00:08:26,920
You like his handsome face.

140
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,879
I need his abilities

141
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,000
and his loyalty.

142
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:33,000
I don't want anything distracting him.

143
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:36,080
You keep saying I'm your daughter,

144
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:37,759
but to you,

145
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:39,240
I'm still less important
than an adjutant.

146
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,919
He's not an adjutant anymore.

147
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,879
I've watched him grow up.

148
00:08:45,879 --> 00:08:47,480
He's like half a son to me.

149
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,960
I've already lost one son
because of you.

150
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,960
Can't you at least leave me that half?

151
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,399
Besides,

152
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:56,399
he's not an adjutant anymore.

153
00:08:56,559 --> 00:08:57,080
Today,

154
00:08:57,399 --> 00:08:58,639
I promoted him to commander.

155
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:01,399
Both the Lu family and the Lu Army

156
00:09:01,399 --> 00:09:03,519
will need him going forward.

157
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:06,080
If you want a handsome man,

158
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,720
Fancheng has plenty.

159
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:12,200
What happened today

160
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,399
must never happen again.

161
00:09:16,799 --> 00:09:18,000
All right.

162
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,399
I'll listen to you, Father.

163
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:22,360
(Ms. Lu was willing to bear)

164
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:24,320
(such disgrace for Commander He.)

165
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,799
(She must really like him.)

166
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:28,639
(If Lady Feng tries
to fight her for him,)

167
00:09:29,639 --> 00:09:30,879
(it won't end well for her.)

168
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,799
(Things have come to this.)

169
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,600
(I'd better secure my own future.)

170
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,399
(One will do.)

171
00:10:09,279 --> 00:10:10,399
What?

172
00:10:10,559 --> 00:10:12,080
Can't bear to wipe it off, Commander He?

173
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,159
I saved both of you.

174
00:10:17,519 --> 00:10:18,559
How will you repay me?

175
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,679
Did you save me so I'd owe you,

176
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,879
or so you'd have leverage over me?

177
00:10:26,279 --> 00:10:29,200
A little of both.

178
00:10:31,519 --> 00:10:33,399
Still, I'm curious.

179
00:10:33,759 --> 00:10:35,480
How exactly do you plan

180
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:37,519
to help Lady Feng pull this off?

181
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,799
There's already a rumor

182
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:42,080
that Lady Feng's baby

183
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:44,200
isn't Iron Leopard's.

184
00:10:48,519 --> 00:10:50,840
Looks like you still don't have a plan.

185
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,080
I'll leave you to it.

186
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:55,559
Before someone says I'm after
your good looks again.

187
00:10:58,679 --> 00:11:00,519
The mess you two made

188
00:11:00,799 --> 00:11:02,720
has already damaged my reputation.

189
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:30,960
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

190
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:35,600
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

191
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:38,760
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

192
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,280
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

193
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:45,640
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

194
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:51,600
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

195
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:56,320
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

196
00:11:56,920 --> 00:11:59,800
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

197
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:02,120
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

198
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:05,360
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

199
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:12,040
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

200
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:15,640
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

201
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:18,840
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

202
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:25,360
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

203
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:28,760
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

204
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:32,080
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

205
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:34,920
♪Boundless♪
